e on CKS with Perses dashboards installed, when an admin navigates to the MaaS observability dashboard, then the dashboard displays token usage per subscription, rate limiting enforcement events, and API key lifecycle metrics over the last 24 hours, measured by dashboard rendering with live data.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR [P0]: Observability metrics functional: token usage, rate limiting enforcement, API key lifecycle events (dashboards and Prometheus integration portion).\n\n## Notes\n\nJoint ownership with the xKS Platform team per the strategy's affected components table (\"MaaS / xKS Platform\"); the xKS Platform team contributes the CKS Prometheus integration.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":78613,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b20b78a95a65165e","agent_id":"a61389ab3fb18a498","session_id":"1e4ce44d-83b4-4c13-8abf-b56141fd026a","uuid":"a3fcc398-4d67-43ae-9461-b8f05aded0e6","timestamp":"2026-10-22T06:12:26.458Z","subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-8003"}
