on events, rate limit enforcement, subscription selection (per Staff Engineer Input).\n\n## Notes\n\nJoint ownership with the xKS Platform team per the strategy's affected components table (\"MaaS / xKS Platform\"); the xKS Platform team contributes the CKS Loki integration. Authorino/Limitador structured logging configuration is guided by the RHCL/OpenShift team per the impacted teams table.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":78613,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b20b78a95a65165e","agent_id":"a61389ab3fb18a498","session_id":"1e4ce44d-83b4-4c13-8abf-b56141fd026a","uuid":"47d2288e-65b7-4f17-af98-ac1bbe8ff610","timestamp":"2026-10-22T06:12:31.444Z","subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-8003"}
